source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Tail a single job or the latest job for a source/destination

Usage: vendo jobs tail [OPTIONS] [jobId]

Arguments:
  [jobId]  

Options:
      --profile <name>               Use a specific account profile
      --source <sourceId>            Tail the latest job for a source
      --debug                        Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --integration <integrationId>  Tail the latest job for a destination
      --next                         Wait for the next new job when tailing a source or destination
      --interval <seconds>           Polling interval in seconds [default: 3]
  -h, --help                         Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo jobs tail <jobId>
  $ vendo jobs tail --source <sourceId>
  $ vendo jobs tail --source <sourceId> --next
  $ vendo jobs tail --integration <integrationId>
